    "detailed_description": "A 2D side-scrolling shooter in which you advance by defeating enemies in a world where everything is made of voxels. Defeat enemies, collect reinforcement items, and take on powerful enemies that appear one after another!<br><br>More than 12 BGM songs are included in the game. The screen switches from stage to stage with unique bosses and gimmicks.<br>It is a simple game with a lot of depth.<br><br><strong>Main Features</strong>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer : 1 ~ 2<br></li><li>Retro graphics<br></li><li>Wide variety of enemies and gimmicks<br></li><li>Stages that stimulate a sense of adventure<br></li><li>Different background music for each stage<br>[Items scattered throughout the stages.<br></li><li>Powerful bosses await you in each stage.<br></li><li>Heated Score Attacks!</li></ul><br><strong>Controls</strong>.<br>Keyboard.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Movement : Arrow keys<br></li><li>Firing : Z key<br></li><li>Menu : Escape<br></li><li>Low speed movement : Shift key<br></li><li>Switch shot : C / V key<br></li><li>Pass option cannons : X key (Multiplay only)</li></ul>Gamepad<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>Movement \uff1aLeft key<br></li><li>Movement : Left stick<br></li><li>Fire : A button<br></li><li>Menu \uff1a Menu button<br></li><li>Switch shot : R / L button<br></li><li>Pass option cannons : X button (Multiplay only)</li></ul><br>Additional actions of 2P (Satellite)<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Entry: CV key or RL button simultaneous long press (during gameplay)<br></li><li>Barrier: C / V key or R / L button</li></ul><br>Powered by &quot;CRIWARE&quot;.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.",
